{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":72520,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2017,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yna6Y31rf8CiT4Wq0rF97u3Zsf1.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1331457","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"大学生の静歌は友達に誘われて、街コンに参加することに。雰囲気になじめずにいた静歌に声をかけてくれたのは、超絶美人なお姉さん・涼だった。一緒に会場を抜け出して打ち解けるけど、急にキスされ押し倒されてしまう。しかも、女の子の体にはない感触が…まさかこの人、女装…！？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fjHxAvnGuAsfnNioNaP59TPCYtc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fjHxAvnGuAsfnNioNaP59TPCYtc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1349091","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"涼との一件が頭から離れない静歌。思い悩んでいると、大学に女装姿の涼が押しかけてくる。友達の前では「女」として振る舞う涼に、静歌は戸惑うばかり。そして強引にトイレで二人きりにさせられて…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g4xIonifR3ainYvoTBJhW2Zrcdr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g4xIonifR3ainYvoTBJhW2Zrcdr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"1349094","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"涼に振り回されっぱなしの静歌は、もう自分に関わらないように言おうと決意する。しかし、会いに行って出てきた涼は、女装ではなく素顔の「男」の姿だった。パニックになった静歌は、涼に流されて連れ出されてしまい…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xsQqjMYkqs1tztvNvFlAWrLQcIt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xsQqjMYkqs1tztvNvFlAWrLQcIt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1349097","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"遊びのつもりで手を出すのはやめてほしいと、涼に伝える静歌。しかし、涼は「遊びじゃない」と真剣な顔で返してくる。涼の気持ちがわからずに静歌がひとりで悩んでいると、チャラい男たちが近づいてきて…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o2S0BOwbvpWMq1QDm9THhZZXL4r.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o2S0BOwbvpWMq1QDm9THhZZXL4r.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1349100","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"涼のファンから逃げてホテルに入った二人。静歌は涼に言われた「好き」という言葉にうろたえてしまう。身勝手さを詫びながらも涼は思いを伝えてくるが、静歌は自分の気持ちがわからなくて…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/svLi3nYm5w65FBLc2b4aQct9RvJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/svLi3nYm5w65FBLc2b4aQct9RvJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1349103","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"静歌の「彼氏候補」になった涼は早速静歌をデートに誘い、遊園地に行くことに。しかし、自分に自信が持てない静歌は、涼の好意を素直に受け止められない。涼は浮かない顔の静歌と観覧車に乗り込んで…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hmVAgeljgIw6QIUGfvjKI2NFRjG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hmVAgeljgIw6QIUGfvjKI2NFRjG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1356376","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"雨宿りのために観覧車に乗った二人は、冷えた体をいたわり合う。くっついて温まりながら、静歌に優しく気持ちを伝える涼。まっすぐな言葉に思わずドキドキしていると、涼が「キスしていい？」と聞いてきて…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l12Th1qZUfcx72BCBio9uaGzSPR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l12Th1qZUfcx72BCBio9uaGzSPR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1356378","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"静歌は涼と一緒に過ごすうちに、だんだんと涼のことを意識し始めていることに気づく。感じたことのない気持ちに戸惑った静歌は、観覧車を降りた後に涼を呼び止めると…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6ubnLwAtDwfvluv6gusUkpRvvEx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6ubnLwAtDwfvluv6gusUkpRvvEx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1398388","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ふとしたおしゃべりの中で涼に「手料理を食べてみたい」と言われた静歌は、思い切って手作りのお菓子を渡しに行く。静歌からのプレゼントに大喜びしてはしゃぐ涼。照れた静歌はお菓子を膝の上に落としてしまい…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7kgLU97RwTwbnupZBYSe2d8tZFS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7kgLU97RwTwbnupZBYSe2d8tZFS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"1398389","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"涼が授業を受けている間、静歌は大学構内を散歩することに。そこで出会った桜井が、涼とお似合いだと噂されていることを知る。涼と桜井が話している姿を見た静歌は、急に胸が苦しくなって…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-09-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aXuUeIR50bLV7sry3w4cfopudrm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aXuUeIR50bLV7sry3w4cfopudrm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"1398390","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ヤキモチを焼いて、涼を突き放してしまった静歌。その上、倉谷から好意を打ち明けられて戸惑ってしまう。静歌はありのままの気持ちで答えるが、その会話を聞いていた涼は静歌の言葉を誤解してしまい…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-09-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1kEVwnG1pNEupQNPYSBzrfcwGtb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1kEVwnG1pNEupQNPYSBzrfcwGtb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"1398391","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"静歌を泣かせてしまい、自分の身勝手さを悔やむ涼。立ち去ろうとする涼に、静歌は勇気を出して思いを伝えて――…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-09-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tPtezfWEoNVpMFYWsyAC9WvwStm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tPtezfWEoNVpMFYWsyAC9WvwStm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72520/season/1"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"4":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"5":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"6":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"7":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"8":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"9":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"10":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"11":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"},"12":{"checkedAt":1793369621710,"status":"ok"}}}
